{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Build</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grid-based furniture placement system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your treetop hotel however you want</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your tree structure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock better furniture and equipment with special perks</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Plan</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategize across four seasons, each with their own unique bird species requirements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare the right food, habitats, and furniture for your expected bird families</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your hard earned coins to improve your guests' experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome unexpected weekly challenges in your hotel</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Host</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fulfill your families' room service requests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control the location of guests in your hotel with a check-in computer system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't let guests leave angry, or your hotel will be forced to close!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Developer Info</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created by a small group of university students for senior project, with plans to continue development after graduation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed without any use of generative AI</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3995530?t=1774634777","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995530/d919d8b59d473846a4b5a96370670c4f1989d232/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774634777","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_ass